    \  iLISI: 0.266  cLISI: 0.984\n  PCR: 0.814  Cell_cycle: 0.363\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.767635  ASW_label: 0.541463  ARI: 0.736356  NMI: 0.709591\n  Graph_conn: 0.879242  kBET: 0.830728  iLISI: 0.266318  cLISI: 0.995415\n  PCR: 0.813595  Cell_cycle: 0.318260\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nAutoResearchEvaluator: Set memory limit to 96g\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nLogos I: Systematic Tuning SOTA - ComBat -> BBKNN -> UMAP (min_dist=1.2)...\n  Executing ComBat pipeline to generate corrected matrix...\n  Applying modification: UMAP min_dist set to 1.2...\n✓ Logos I: Systematic tuning complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: False\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/975ed161-c46b-42f5-8b71-245611ba8e0f/result_human.h5ad\n\
    \nRESULT_UUID: 975ed161-c46b-42f5-8b71-245611ba8e0f\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/tmp/tmpnawq0ri0/submission.py:49: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  g_new = (t2 * n * g_old + d_old * gamma_bar) / (t2 * n + d_old)\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Systematic Tuning: UMAP min_dist at 1.2' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 51.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle\
    \ | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 51 | 1 | Systematic Tuning: UMAP min_dist at 1.2 | Logos I | 24 | 0.6366 | 0.736 | 0.520 | 0.225 | 0.363 | 0.877 | 0.710 | 0.814 | 0.984 | 0.266 | 0.872 |\n| 44 | 1 | Further Tuning: Pushing UMAP min_dist to 1.0 | Logos I | 22 | 0.6353 | 0.760 | 0.481 | 0.230 | 0.372 | 0.862 | 0.717 | 0.814 | 0.983 | 0.262 | 0.872 |\n| 39 | 1 | Parameter Tuning: Increasing UMAP min_dist for Global Structure | Logos I | 20 | 0.6267 | 0.742 | 0.438 | 0.236 | 0.375 | 0.846 | 0.706 | 0.811 | 0.987 | 0.261 | 0.865 |\n| 31 | 1 | SOTA Attempt: ComBat Pre-correction + BBKNN->UMAP Synthesis | Logos I | 17 | 0.6135 | 0.754 | 0.357 | 0.243 | 0.388 | 0.802 | 0.705 | 0.804 | 0.988 | 0.258 | 0.835 |\n| 28 | 1 | Synthesized Embedding: UMAP on a BBKNN-derived Graph | Logos I | 15 | 0.5858 | 0.777 | 0.307 | 0.240 | 0.468 | 0.829 | 0.727 | 0.429 | 0.988 | 0.231 | 0.861 |\n| 18 | 1 | Hybrid Method:\
    \ ComBat Embedding with BBKNN Graph | Logos I | 12 | 0.5894 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.602 |\n| 13 | 1 | Synergistic Integration: ComBat Correction followed by BBKNN | Logos I | 10 | 0.3082 | 0.493 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 0.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.000 |\n| 9 | 1 | ComBat + PCA + KNN Graph | Logos I | 9 | 0.5892 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.600 |\n| 6 | 1 | ComBat with KNN Graph Construction for Improved Local Integration | Logos I | 8 | 0.2549 | 0.317 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.661 | 0.450 | 0.000 | 0.826 | 0.294 | 0.000 |\n| 2 | 1 | Combat Manual Baseline | System | 0 | 0.5895 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.603 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}`\
