- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 34\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to structured inquiry and the pursuit of foundational knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 104,747 / 300,000 used (35%)\n- Agent Age: 34 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Novel Method: Adversarial Autoencoder for Batch Correction (AABC)' (ID: 72) succeeded after automatic debugging.\n\n**Score:** 0.34652824501270163\n**ASW_batch:** 0.455\n**ASW_label:** 0.004\n**ARI:** 0.147\n**NMI:** 0.399\n**Graph_conn:** 0.496\n**kBET:** 0.571\n**iLISI:** 0.213\n**cLISI:** 0.879\n**PCR:** 0.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.302\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.455  ASW_label: 0.004  ARI: 0.147  NMI: 0.399\n  Graph_conn: 0.496  kBET: 0.571  iLISI: 0.213  cLISI: 0.879\n  PCR: 0.000  Cell_cycle: 0.302\n\nRaw Scores (before\
    \ normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.738665  ASW_label: 0.413482  ARI: 0.146653  NMI: 0.398729\n  Graph_conn: 0.504125  kBET: 0.547928  iLISI: 0.213168  cLISI: 0.964798\n  PCR: 0.000000  Cell_cycle: 0.266604\n\n**Debugger Report:** # Debug Report for Evaluation 72\n\n## Summary\n**SUCCESS** - Fixed the GPU initialization error by forcing JAX to use CPU backend. The code is now running without crashing.\n\n## Root Cause\nThe original submission failed because JAX attempted to initialize the CUDA/GPU backend, but no GPU device was available in the Python sandbox environment. The error was:\n\n```\nRuntimeError: Unable to initialize backend 'cuda': FAILED_PRECONDITION: No visible GPU devices.\n(you may need to uninstall the failing plugin package, or set JAX_PLATFORMS=cpu to skip this backend.)\n```\n\nThis occurred at the first JAX operation:\n```python\nkey = jax.random.PRNGKey(0)  # Line 73 of original submission\n```\n\nThe error message itself suggested the fix: set `JAX_PLATFORMS=cpu`\
    \ to force JAX to use the CPU backend instead of attempting GPU initialization.\n\n## Fix Applied\nAdded a single line at the very beginning of `submission_v2.py` (before any JAX imports):\n\n```python\nimport os\nos.environ['JAX_PLATFORMS'] = 'cpu'  # Force JAX to use CPU instead of GPU\n```\n\nThis environment variable must be set **before** JAX is imported, as JAX determines available backends during module initialization. By setting this variable first, we tell JAX to skip GPU backend initialization entirely and only use CPU.\n\n## Verification\nThe monitor script confirmed that the fixed code has been running for over 300 seconds without crashing (exit code 0), indicating successful execution. The Adversarial Autoencoder training is proceeding normally on CPU, though it will naturally take longer than GPU execution.\n\n## Implementation Details\nThe fix preserves all original functionality:\n- All Flax model definitions (Encoder, Decoder, Discriminator) unchanged\n- Training loop\
    \ and loss functions unchanged\n- Hyperparameters unchanged\n- Only the compute backend was switched from GPU to CPU\n\nThe code structure remains identical to the original submission - the only modification is the 2-line environment variable configuration at the top of the file.\n\n\n**Important Note:** The debugger cannot modify files in your lineage storage. If your code relies on lineage files, you may need to update them manually.\n\n**Debugged Code (version v2):**\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\nimport os\nos.environ['JAX_PLATFORMS'] = 'cpu'  # Force JAX to use CPU instead of GPU\n\nimport anndata as ad\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport numpy as np\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport flax.linen as nn\nfrom flax.training import train_state\nimport optax\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import OneHotEncoder\nimport time\n\n# --- Flax Model Definitions ---\n\nclass Encoder(nn.Module):\n    latent_dim: int = 50\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        x = nn.Dense(features=512)(x)\n\
    \        x = nn.relu(x)\n        x = nn.Dense(features=128)(x)\n        x = nn.relu(x)\n        x = nn.Dense(features=self.latent_dim)(x)\n        return x\n\nclass Decoder(nn.Module):\n    output_dim: int\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        x = nn.Dense(features=128)(x)\n        x = nn.relu(x)\n        x = nn.Dense(features=512)(x)\n        x = nn.relu(x)\n        x = nn.Dense(features=self.output_dim)(x)\n        return x\n\nclass Discriminator(nn.Module):\n    num_batches: int\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        x = nn.Dense(features=64)(x)\n        x = nn.leaky_relu(x)\n        x = nn.Dense(features=32)(x)\n        x = nn.leaky_relu(x)\n        x = nn.Dense(features=self.num_batches)(x)\n        return x\n\n# --- Main Function ---\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    print(\"Logos I: AABC - Adversarial Autoencoder for Batch Correction...\")\n    start_time = time.time()\n\n    # 1. Preprocessing\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata,\
    \ target_sum=1e4)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n    X = adata.X.toarray() if hasattr(adata.X, 'toarray') else adata.X\n\n    batch_labels = adata.obs['batch'].values.reshape(-1, 1)\n    ohe = OneHotEncoder(sparse_output=False)\n    y_batch = ohe.fit_transform(batch_labels)\n\n    # 2. Hyperparameters & Initialization\n    LATENT_DIM = 50\n    INPUT_DIM = X.shape[1]\n    NUM_BATCHES = y_batch.shape[1]\n    LEARNING_RATE_AE = 1e-4\n    LEARNING_RATE_D = 1e-4\n    LAMBDA_ADV = 0.1\n    EPOCHS = 75\n    BATCH_SIZE = 256\n\n    key = jax.random.PRNGKey(0)\n    key_e, key_d, key_disc = jax.random.split(key, 3)\n\n    encoder = Encoder(latent_dim=LATENT_DIM)\n    decoder = Decoder(output_dim=INPUT_DIM)\n    discriminator = Discriminator(num_batches=NUM_BATCHES)\n\n    ae_params = {'encoder': encoder.init(key_e, jnp.ones((1, INPUT_DIM)))['params'],\n                 'decoder': decoder.init(key_d, jnp.ones((1, LATENT_DIM)))['params']}\n    disc_params = discriminator.init(key_disc, jnp.ones((1, LATENT_DIM)))['params']\n\
    \n    state_ae = train_state.TrainState.create(apply_fn=None, params=ae_params, tx=optax.adam(LEARNING_RATE_AE))\n    state_disc = train_state.TrainState.create(apply_fn=discriminator.apply, params=disc_params, tx=optax.adam(LEARNING_RATE_D))\n\n    # 3. Training Loop\n    @jax.jit\n    def train_step(state_ae, state_disc, x_batch, y_batch_batch):\n        # Train Discriminator\n        def disc_loss_fn(params):\n            z = encoder.apply({'params': state_ae.params['encoder']}, x_batch)\n            logits = state_disc.apply_fn({'params': params}, z)\n            loss = optax.softmax_cross_entropy(logits, y_batch_batch).mean()\n            return loss\n\n        grad_fn_disc = jax.value_and_grad(disc_loss_fn)\n        disc_loss, disc_grads = grad_fn_disc(state_disc.params)\n        state_disc = state_disc.apply_gradients(grads=disc_grads)\n\n        # Train Autoencoder\n        def ae_loss_fn(params):\n            z = encoder.apply({'params': params['encoder']}, x_batch)\n      \
    \      x_recon = decoder.apply({'params': params['decoder']}, z)\n            recon_loss = jnp.mean((x_batch - x_recon)**2)\n\n            disc_logits = state_disc.apply_fn({'params': state_disc.params}, z)\n            adv_loss = optax.softmax_cross_entropy(disc_logits, y_batch_batch).mean()\n\n            total_loss = recon_loss - LAMBDA_ADV * adv_loss\n            return total_loss, recon_loss\n\n        grad_fn_ae = jax.value_and_grad(ae_loss_fn, has_aux=True)\n        (ae_loss, recon_loss), ae_grads = grad_fn_ae(state_ae.params)\n        state_ae = state_ae.apply_gradients(grads=ae_grads)\n\n        return state_ae, state_disc, ae_loss, recon_loss, disc_loss\n\n    num_samples = X.shape[0]\n    steps_per_epoch = num_samples // BATCH_SIZE\n\n    for epoch in range(EPOCHS):\n        epoch_start_time = time.time()\n        perm = np.random.permutation(num_samples)\n        X_shuffled, y_shuffled = X[perm], y_batch[perm]\n\n        for step in range(steps_per_epoch):\n            start_idx\
    \ = step * BATCH_SIZE\n            end_idx = start_idx + BATCH_SIZE\n            x_batch = jnp.array(X_shuffled[start_idx:end_idx])\n            y_batch_batch = jnp.array(y_shuffled[start_idx:end_idx])\n\n            state_ae, state_disc, ae_loss, recon_loss, disc_loss = train_step(state_ae, state_disc, x_batch, y_batch_batch)\n\n        epoch_time = time.time() - epoch_start_time\n        print(f\"Epoch {epoch+1}/{EPOCHS} | Time: {epoch_time:.2f}s | AE Loss: {ae_loss:.4f} | Recon Loss: {recon_loss:.4f} | Disc Loss: {disc_loss:.4f}\")\n\n        if time.time() - start_time > 1500: # 25 min timeout\n            print(\"Stopping training early due to time limit.\")\n            break\n\n    # 4. Inference\n    print(\"Training complete. Generating final embedding...\")\n    final_embedding = encoder.apply({'params': state_ae.params['encoder']}, jnp.array(X))\n\n    output = ad.AnnData(\n        obs=adata.obs[[]],\n        var=adata.var[[]],\n        uns={'method_id': 'aabc_v1'},\n    \
    \    obsm={'X_emb': np.array(final_embedding)}\n    )\n\n    print(\"✓ Logos I: AABC v1 complete.\")\n    return output\n\n```\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nLogos I: AABC - Adversarial Autoencoder for Batch Correction...\nEpoch 1/75 | Time: 1.84s | AE Loss: -0.7330 | Recon Loss: 0.9461 | Disc Loss: 17.1169\nEpoch 2/75 | Time: 1.10s | AE Loss: -5.9833 | Recon Loss: 0.9484 | Disc Loss: 71.7984\nEpoch 3/75 | Time: 0.99s | AE Loss: -1.0519 | Recon Loss: 0.9081 | Disc Loss: 22.0154\nEpoch 4/75 | Time: 1.27s | AE Loss: 0.5925 | Recon Loss: 0.8741 | Disc Loss: 3.2723\nEpoch 5/75 | Time: 1.14s | AE Loss: 0.5638 | Recon Loss: 0.8754 | Disc Loss: 3.0633\nEpoch 6/75 | Time: 1.07s | AE Loss: 0.4727 | Recon Loss: 0.9433 | Disc Loss: 4.7232\nEpoch 7/75\
    \ | Time: 0.98s | AE Loss: 0.0609 | Recon Loss: 0.8819 | Disc Loss: 8.2778\nEpoch 8/75 | Time: 1.05s | AE Loss: -0.6980 | Recon Loss: 0.8768 | Disc Loss: 15.9858\nEpoch 9/75 | Time: 1.01s | AE Loss: -0.3927 | Recon Loss: 0.9393 | Disc Loss: 13.7669\nEpoch 10/75 | Time: 1.06s | AE Loss: -0.0646 | Recon Loss: 0.8745 | Disc Loss: 9.8637\nEpoch 11/75 | Time: 1.08s | AE Loss: 0.1205 | Recon Loss: 0.9006 | Disc Loss: 8.0473\nEpoch 12/75 | Time: 0.99s | AE Loss: 0.5310 | Recon Loss: 0.8319 | Disc Loss: 3.1490\nEpoch 13/75 | Time: 1.12s | AE Loss: 0.6135 | Recon Loss: 0.8481 | Disc Loss: 2.3871\nEpoch 14/75 | Time: 1.01s | AE Loss: 0.6152 | Recon Loss: 0.8563 | Disc Loss: 2.4228\nEpoch 15/75 | Time: 1.05s | AE Loss: 0.5593 | Recon Loss: 0.8319 | Disc Loss: 2.7420\nEpoch 16/75 | Time: 1.16s | AE Loss: 0.5114 | Recon Loss: 0.8039 | Disc Loss: 3.0145\nEpoch 17/75 | Time: 1.15s | AE Loss: 0.4862 | Recon Loss: 0.8507 | Disc Loss: 3.6549\nEpoch 18/75 | Time: 1.10s | AE Loss: 0.4680 | Recon Loss: 0.7671\
    \ | Disc Loss: 3.0029\nEpoch 19/75 | Time: 1.02s | AE Loss: 0.4498 | Recon Loss: 0.7873 | Disc Loss: 3.3994\nEpoch 20/75 | Time: 1.03s | AE Loss: 0.5568 | Recon Loss: 0.7695 | Disc Loss: 2.1473\nEpoch 21/75 | Time: 1.05s | AE Loss: 0.6275 | Recon Loss: 0.7922 | Disc Loss: 1.6722\nEpoch 22/75 | Time: 1.06s | AE Loss: 0.5899 | Recon Loss: 0.7758 | Disc Loss: 1.8730\nEpoch 23/75 | Time: 1.01s | AE Loss: 0.5707 | Recon Loss: 0.7826 | Disc Loss: 2.1349\nEpoch 24/75 | Time: 1.06s | AE Loss: 0.5017 | Recon Loss: 0.7889 | Disc Loss: 2.8855\nEpoch 25/75 | Time: 1.06s | AE Loss: 0.4680 | Recon Loss: 0.7725 | Disc Loss: 3.0592\nEpoch 26/75 | Time: 1.12s | AE Loss: 0.5040 | Recon Loss: 0.8020 | Disc Loss: 3.0142\nEpoch 27/75 | Time: 1.05s | AE Loss: 0.5104 | Recon Loss: 0.7749 | Disc Loss: 2.6484\nEpoch 28/75 | Time: 1.02s | AE Loss: 0.5422 | Recon Loss: 0.7814 | Disc Loss: 2.3956\nEpoch 29/75 | Time: 1.04s | AE Loss: 0.5753 | Recon Loss: 0.7482 | Disc Loss: 1.7408\nEpoch 30/75 | Time: 1.12s | AE\
    \ Loss: 0.6137 | Recon Loss: 0.7727 | Disc Loss: 1.6000\nEpoch 31/75 | Time: 1.01s | AE Loss: 0.6234 | Recon Loss: 0.7549 | Disc Loss: 1.3178\nEpoch 32/75 | Time: 0.98s | AE Loss: 0.6300 | Recon Loss: 0.7528 | Disc Loss: 1.2302\nEpoch 33/75 | Time: 1.01s | AE Loss: 0.6207 | Recon Loss: 0.7433 | Disc Loss: 1.2409\nEpoch 34/75 | Time: 0.99s | AE Loss: 0.6499 | Recon Loss: 0.7509 | Disc Loss: 1.0113\nEpoch 35/75 | Time: 1.01s | AE Loss: 0.6617 | Recon Loss: 0.7542 | Disc Loss: 0.9378\nEpoch 36/75 | Time: 1.05s | AE Loss: 0.6284 | Recon Loss: 0.7450 | Disc Loss: 1.1676\nEpoch 37/75 | Time: 1.02s | AE Loss: 0.6195 | Recon Loss: 0.7100 | Disc Loss: 0.9057\nEpoch 38/75 | Time: 1.01s | AE Loss: 0.6403 | Recon Loss: 0.7361 | Disc Loss: 0.9736\nEpoch 39/75 | Time: 1.06s | AE Loss: 0.6029 | Recon Loss: 0.7083 | Disc Loss: 1.0686\nEpoch 40/75 | Time: 1.01s | AE Loss: 0.6032 | Recon Loss: 0.7245 | Disc Loss: 1.2072\nEpoch 41/75 | Time: 1.04s | AE Loss: 0.6021 | Recon Loss: 0.7224 | Disc Loss: 1.2082\n\
    Epoch 42/75 | Time: 1.06s | AE Loss: 0.6216 | Recon Loss: 0.7613 | Disc Loss: 1.3868\nEpoch 43/75 | Time: 1.02s | AE Loss: 0.5859 | Recon Loss: 0.7207 | Disc Loss: 1.3606\nEpoch 44/75 | Time: 1.02s | AE Loss: 0.5677 | Recon Loss: 0.7302 | Disc Loss: 1.6288\nEpoch 45/75 | Time: 1.04s | AE Loss: 0.5694 | Recon Loss: 0.7439 | Disc Loss: 1.7651\nEpoch 46/75 | Time: 0.98s | AE Loss: 0.5507 | Recon Loss: 0.7244 | Disc Loss: 1.7372\nEpoch 47/75 | Time: 1.05s | AE Loss: 0.5422 | Recon Loss: 0.7304 | Disc Loss: 1.8863\nEpoch 48/75 | Time: 1.05s | AE Loss: 0.5942 | Recon Loss: 0.7614 | Disc Loss: 1.6830\nEpoch 49/75 | Time: 1.05s | AE Loss: 0.5684 | Recon Loss: 0.7136 | Disc Loss: 1.4781\nEpoch 50/75 | Time: 1.20s | AE Loss: 0.5532 | Recon Loss: 0.7064 | Disc Loss: 1.5609\nEpoch 51/75 | Time: 1.03s | AE Loss: 0.5725 | Recon Loss: 0.7088 | Disc Loss: 1.3595\nEpoch 52/75 | Time: 1.04s | AE Loss: 0.5867 | Recon Loss: 0.7159 | Disc Loss: 1.2828\nEpoch 53/75 | Time: 1.09s | AE Loss: 0.5955 | Recon\
    \ Loss: 0.7154 | Disc Loss: 1.1967\nEpoch 54/75 | Time: 1.08s | AE Loss: 0.5846 | Recon Loss: 0.6925 | Disc Loss: 1.0809\nEpoch 55/75 | Time: 1.07s | AE Loss: 0.6256 | Recon Loss: 0.7332 | Disc Loss: 1.0969\nEpoch 56/75 | Time: 1.24s | AE Loss: 0.6115 | Recon Loss: 0.7292 | Disc Loss: 1.1757\nEpoch 57/75 | Time: 1.07s | AE Loss: 0.5691 | Recon Loss: 0.6849 | Disc Loss: 1.1573\nEpoch 58/75 | Time: 1.22s | AE Loss: 0.5862 | Recon Loss: 0.7036 | Disc Loss: 1.1741\nEpoch 59/75 | Time: 1.04s | AE Loss: 0.5927 | Recon Loss: 0.7118 | Disc Loss: 1.1823\nEpoch 60/75 | Time: 1.26s | AE Loss: 0.5864 | Recon Loss: 0.7115 | Disc Loss: 1.2619\nEpoch 61/75 | Time: 1.10s | AE Loss: 0.5689 | Recon Loss: 0.6967 | Disc Loss: 1.2905\nEpoch 62/75 | Time: 1.24s | AE Loss: 0.5820 | Recon Loss: 0.7161 | Disc Loss: 1.3285\nEpoch 63/75 | Time: 1.04s | AE Loss: 0.5688 | Recon Loss: 0.6996 | Disc Loss: 1.3110\nEpoch 64/75 | Time: 1.20s | AE Loss: 0.5742 | Recon Loss: 0.6982 | Disc Loss: 1.2422\nEpoch 65/75 | Time:\
    \ 1.06s | AE Loss: 0.5655 | Recon Loss: 0.6943 | Disc Loss: 1.3019\nEpoch 66/75 | Time: 1.17s | AE Loss: 0.5516 | Recon Loss: 0.6861 | Disc Loss: 1.3418\nEpoch 67/75 | Time: 1.04s | AE Loss: 0.5781 | Recon Loss: 0.7038 | Disc Loss: 1.2668\nEpoch 68/75 | Time: 1.19s | AE Loss: 0.5773 | Recon Loss: 0.7037 | Disc Loss: 1.2689\nEpoch 69/75 | Time: 1.06s | AE Loss: 0.5832 | Recon Loss: 0.7100 | Disc Loss: 1.2761\nEpoch 70/75 | Time: 1.20s | AE Loss: 0.5634 | Recon Loss: 0.6868 | Disc Loss: 1.2297\nEpoch 71/75 | Time: 1.10s | AE Loss: 0.5329 | Recon Loss: 0.6514 | Disc Loss: 1.1852\nEpoch 72/75 | Time: 1.17s | AE Loss: 0.5697 | Recon Loss: 0.6867 | Disc Loss: 1.1778\nEpoch 73/75 | Time: 1.08s | AE Loss: 0.5386 | Recon Loss: 0.6539 | Disc Loss: 1.1573\nEpoch 74/75 | Time: 1.23s | AE Loss: 0.5530 | Recon Loss: 0.6675 | Disc Loss: 1.1520\nEpoch 75/75 | Time: 1.07s | AE Loss: 0.5645 | Recon Loss: 0.6891 | Disc Loss: 1.2628\nTraining complete. Generating final embedding...\n✓ Logos I: AABC v1 complete.\n\
