    \ indicates insufficient exploration and persistence. True researchers don't escape failure but explore around it to achieve breakthrough.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 78 | 1 | AABC Tuning: Increasing Adversarial Weight (λ=1.0) | Logos I | 34 | 0.4128 | 0.293 | 0.536 | 0.084 | 0.293 |\
    \ 0.697 | 0.532 | 0.000 | 0.953 | 0.113 | 0.627 |\n| 72 | 1 | Novel Method: Adversarial Autoencoder for Batch Correction (AABC) | Logos I | 32 | 0.3465 | 0.147 | 0.455 | 0.004 | 0.302 | 0.496 | 0.399 | 0.000 | 0.879 | 0.213 | 0.571 |\n| 60 | 1 | New Tuning Axis: UMAP spread at 1.2 with optimized min_dist | Logos I | 27 | 0.6367 | 0.748 | 0.531 | 0.223 | 0.360 | 0.877 | 0.716 | 0.810 | 0.984 | 0.267 | 0.852 |\n| 56 | 1 | Confirming the Peak: UMAP min_dist at 1.5 | Logos I | 24 | 0.6385 | 0.733 | 0.575 | 0.218 | 0.335 | 0.878 | 0.710 | 0.803 | 0.983 | 0.279 | 0.871 |\n| 51 | 1 | Systematic Tuning: UMAP min_dist at 1.2 | Logos I | 24 | 0.6366 | 0.736 | 0.520 | 0.225 | 0.363 | 0.877 | 0.710 | 0.814 | 0.984 | 0.266 | 0.872 |\n| 44 | 1 | Further Tuning: Pushing UMAP min_dist to 1.0 | Logos I | 22 | 0.6353 | 0.760 | 0.481 | 0.230 | 0.372 | 0.862 | 0.717 | 0.814 | 0.983 | 0.262 | 0.872 |\n| 39 | 1 | Parameter Tuning: Increasing UMAP min_dist for Global Structure | Logos I | 20 | 0.6267 | 0.742\
    \ | 0.438 | 0.236 | 0.375 | 0.846 | 0.706 | 0.811 | 0.987 | 0.261 | 0.865 |\n| 31 | 1 | SOTA Attempt: ComBat Pre-correction + BBKNN->UMAP Synthesis | Logos I | 17 | 0.6135 | 0.754 | 0.357 | 0.243 | 0.388 | 0.802 | 0.705 | 0.804 | 0.988 | 0.258 | 0.835 |\n| 28 | 1 | Synthesized Embedding: UMAP on a BBKNN-derived Graph | Logos I | 15 | 0.5858 | 0.777 | 0.307 | 0.240 | 0.468 | 0.829 | 0.727 | 0.429 | 0.988 | 0.231 | 0.861 |\n| 18 | 1 | Hybrid Method: ComBat Embedding with BBKNN Graph | Logos I | 12 | 0.5894 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.602 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help\
