    \ | Time: 1.31s | Recon Loss: 22.8889 | Disc Loss: 25.7128\nEpoch 40/75 | Time: 1.37s | Recon Loss: 12.3894 | Disc Loss: 36.8066\nEpoch 45/75 | Time: 1.46s | Recon Loss: 18.3309 | Disc Loss: 51.1208\nEpoch 50/75 | Time: 1.18s | Recon Loss: 147.9086 | Disc Loss: 67.2758\nEpoch 55/75 | Time: 1.17s | Recon Loss: 91.5580 | Disc Loss: 85.9952\nEpoch 60/75 | Time: 1.34s | Recon Loss: 99.5528 | Disc Loss: 107.9977\nEpoch 65/75 | Time: 1.42s | Recon Loss: 56.7691 | Disc Loss: 120.4636\nEpoch 70/75 | Time: 1.44s | Recon Loss: 94.7438 | Disc Loss: 149.2964\nEpoch 75/75 | Time: 1.39s | Recon Loss: 69.4904 | Disc Loss: 162.3890\nTraining complete. Generating final embedding...\n✓ Logos I: AABC v3 complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: False\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/264095e5-749d-40a0-97a7-d875843263ed/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 264095e5-749d-40a0-97a7-d875843263ed\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action\
