    \ Batch Loss: 2.320, Pseudo Loss: 2.410\nAdv Epoch 60/60 | Recon: 2.664, Batch Loss: 6.167, Pseudo Loss: 9.476\nTraining complete. Generating final embedding...\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: False\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/4618143e-e3b5-4e30-9cf1-0e4d92ac71cc/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 4618143e-e3b5-4e30-9cf1-0e4d92ac71cc\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch\
    \ | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 98 | 1 | CAABC v2 (Fix): Unsupervised Clustering for Biological Preservation | Logos I | 44 | 0.2677 | 0.056 | 0.488 | 0.000 | 0.229 | 0.348 | 0.247 | 0.000 | 0.788 | 0.182 | 0.339 |\n| 96 | 1 | Novel Method v2: Conditional Adversarial Autoencoder (CAABC) | Logos I | 43 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 86 | 1 | AABC Tuning: High Adversarial Weight (λ=5.0) | Logos I | 38 | 0.4120 | 0.359 | 0.543 | 0.059 | 0.304 | 0.747 | 0.528 | 0.000 | 0.937 | 0.031 | 0.611 |\n| 82 | 1 | AABC Tuning: Reducing Discriminator Learning Rate | Logos I | 36 | 0.1462 | 0.020 | 0.416 | 0.000 | 0.245 | 0.038 | 0.077 | 0.000 | 0.371 | 0.209 | 0.086 |\n| 78 | 1 | AABC Tuning: Increasing Adversarial Weight (λ=1.0) | Logos I | 34 | 0.4128 | 0.293 | 0.536 | 0.084 | 0.293 | 0.697 | 0.532 | 0.000 | 0.953 | 0.113 | 0.627 |\n| 72 | 1 | Novel Method: Adversarial Autoencoder\
    \ for Batch Correction (AABC) | Logos I | 32 | 0.3465 | 0.147 | 0.455 | 0.004 | 0.302 | 0.496 | 0.399 | 0.000 | 0.879 | 0.213 | 0.571 |\n| 60 | 1 | New Tuning Axis: UMAP spread at 1.2 with optimized min_dist | Logos I | 27 | 0.6367 | 0.748 | 0.531 | 0.223 | 0.360 | 0.877 | 0.716 | 0.810 | 0.984 | 0.267 | 0.852 |\n| 56 | 1 | Confirming the Peak: UMAP min_dist at 1.5 | Logos I | 24 | 0.6385 | 0.733 | 0.575 | 0.218 | 0.335 | 0.878 | 0.710 | 0.803 | 0.983 | 0.279 | 0.871 |\n| 51 | 1 | Systematic Tuning: UMAP min_dist at 1.2 | Logos I | 24 | 0.6366 | 0.736 | 0.520 | 0.225 | 0.363 | 0.877 | 0.710 | 0.814 | 0.984 | 0.266 | 0.872 |\n| 44 | 1 | Further Tuning: Pushing UMAP min_dist to 1.0 | Logos I | 22 | 0.6353 | 0.760 | 0.481 | 0.230 | 0.372 | 0.862 | 0.717 | 0.814 | 0.983 | 0.262 | 0.872 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
    \ tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
