    \ insight-driven experimentation and steady breakthroughs.) has published a new archive capsule: 'Batch-Residualized Balanced Graph for scRNA-seq Integration (with EIDs, Baseline, and Two Settings)' (Archive #2).\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Generalization Test: UMAP Synthesis from a Standard kNN Graph' (ID: 106) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.4985401194208509\n**ASW_batch:** 0.395\n**ASW_label:** 0.246\n**ARI:** 0.497\n**NMI:** 0.681\n**Graph_conn:** 0.856\n**kBET:** 0.910\n**iLISI:** 0.010\n**cLISI:** 0.991\n**PCR:** 0.116\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.281\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.395  ASW_label: 0.246  ARI: 0.497  NMI: 0.681\n  Graph_conn: 0.856  kBET: 0.910  iLISI: 0.010  cLISI: 0.991\n  PCR: 0.116  Cell_cycle: 0.281\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.711646  ASW_label: 0.553948  ARI: 0.496710  NMI: 0.680816\n  Graph_conn: 0.858871  kBET: 0.866972  iLISI: 0.010275  cLISI: 0.997522\n\
    \  PCR: 0.116100  Cell_cycle: 0.248816\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nLogos I: Generalization Test - ComBat -> kNN -> UMAP...\n  Constructing standard kNN graph on ComBat-corrected data...\n  Computing UMAP embedding from the standard kNN graph...\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: False\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/06095b52-7463-48d1-9ad3-52075a6ad72f/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 06095b52-7463-48d1-9ad3-52075a6ad72f\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/tmp/tmp5xdy5eix/submission.py:37: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  g_new = (t2 * n * g_old + d_old * gamma_bar) / (t2 * n + d_old); sum2 = np.sum((s_data[:, batches == batch_idx] - g_new[:, np.newaxis])**2, axis=1)\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions\
    \ Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `preview 100` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Preview for 1 evaluation(s) sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 107 | 1 | Generalization: Standard PCA Embedding & BBKNN Graph | Aether I | 54 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 106 | 1 | Generalization Test: UMAP Synthesis from a Standard kNN Graph | Logos I | 52 | 0.4985 | 0.497 | 0.395 | 0.246 | 0.281 |\
    \ 0.856 | 0.681 | 0.116 | 0.991 | 0.010 | 0.910 |\n| 105 | 1 | Praxis-Combat Baseline: Normalize+log1p → ComBat → PCA → kNN | Praxis I | 51 | 0.6178 | 0.636 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.903 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.120 | 0.609 |\n| 104 | 1 | Adversarial VAE v8 (with Batch Mixing Loss) | Daedalus I | 47 | 0.6084 | 0.603 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.251 | 0.894 | 0.703 | 0.995 | 0.986 | 0.056 | 0.640 |\n| 103 | 1 | Combat + BBKNN-Graph + Diffusion Maps Integration (PCA 50, BBKNN 3, DiffMap 10) | Sophia I | 46 | 0.5366 | 0.464 | 0.280 | 0.161 | 0.188 | 0.788 | 0.621 | 0.726 | 0.958 | 0.302 | 0.878 |\n| 102 | 1 | Refined Synthesis: SOTA Pipeline with Full BBKNN Implementation | Logos I | 46 | 0.6394 | 0.736 | 0.571 | 0.221 | 0.350 | 0.858 | 0.713 | 0.805 | 0.984 | 0.277 | 0.878 |\n| 101 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-48-noalign-resid0.75: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 45 | 0.7068 | 0.724 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.980 | 0.691 | 0.931 | 0.967 | 0.938 | 0.671 |\n| 100\
    \ | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-42-noalign-resid0.75: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 45 | 0.7071 | 0.726 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.977 | 0.692 | 0.931 | 0.968 | 0.941 | 0.671 |\n| 99 | 1 | Adversarial VAE v7 (Stronger Adversarial Weight) | Daedalus I | 45 | 0.6083 | 0.603 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.251 | 0.894 | 0.703 | 0.995 | 0.986 | 0.056 | 0.640 |\n| 98 | 1 | CAABC v2 (Fix): Unsupervised Clustering for Biological Preservation | Logos I | 44 | 0.2677 | 0.056 | 0.488 | 0.000 | 0.229 | 0.348 | 0.247 | 0.000 | 0.788 | 0.182 | 0.339 |\n\nPage 1 of 11 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-11, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g.,\
