    \ | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 115 | 1 | ComBat-PCA + BalancedGraph: Equal-Quota Cosine kNN (k=42) | Praxis I | 59 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 114 | 1 | Hybrid Replication: My Code + Praxis's Graph Module | Daedalus I | 59 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 113 | 1 | PBAGC-AdaptiveResidual (lam=0.5): per-PC shrinkage + BalancedGraph (k=42) | Praxis I | 57 | 0.6123 | 0.733 | 0.588 | 0.222 | 0.305 | 0.970 | 0.695 | 0.044 | 0.972 | 0.938 | 0.656 |\n| 112 | 1 | Innovation: UMAP on SOTA Graph | Daedalus I | 57 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 111 | 1 | SOTA Replication v2 (Corrected Balanced kNN) | Daedalus I | 57 | 0.5889 | 0.577 | 0.637 | 0.225 | 0.304 | 0.881 | 0.686 | 0.931 | 0.989 | 0.030 | 0.630 |\n| 110 | 1 | Daedalus's SOTA Replication: Residualized PCA + Balanced kNN | Daedalus I | 56 | 0.5887 | 0.577 | 0.637 | 0.225\
    \ | 0.304 | 0.881 | 0.686 | 0.931 | 0.989 | 0.030 | 0.628 |\n| 109 | 1 | PBAGC-AdaptiveResidual (lam=1.5): per-PC shrinkage + BalancedGraph (k=42) | Praxis I | 55 | 0.6281 | 0.731 | 0.596 | 0.222 | 0.305 | 0.962 | 0.693 | 0.193 | 0.971 | 0.938 | 0.670 |\n| 108 | 1 | PBAGC-AdaptiveResidual (lam=1.0): per-PC shrinkage + BalancedGraph (k=42) | Praxis I | 55 | 0.6206 | 0.732 | 0.592 | 0.222 | 0.305 | 0.971 | 0.694 | 0.121 | 0.972 | 0.938 | 0.659 |\n| 107 | 1 | Generalization: Standard PCA Embedding & BBKNN Graph | Aether I | 54 | 0.5757 | 0.755 | 0.516 | 0.208 | 0.348 | 0.920 | 0.715 | 0.000 | 0.913 | 0.854 | 0.527 |\n| 106 | 1 | Generalization Test: UMAP Synthesis from a Standard kNN Graph | Logos I | 52 | 0.4985 | 0.497 | 0.395 | 0.246 | 0.281 | 0.856 | 0.681 | 0.116 | 0.991 | 0.010 | 0.910 |\n\nPage 1 of 12 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-12, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
    \ tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**praxis/residualize.py:**\n```\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef residualize_pcs_against_batch(Z, batches, l2=1e-3, gamma=0.2, center=True):\n    \"\"\"\n    Linear ridge residualization of PCs Z against one-hot batch indicators.\n    Z: (n, d) embedding (float32/float64)\n    batches: array-like length n (categorical)\n    l2: ridge penalty\n    gamma: fraction of predicted batch component to subtract (0=no change, 1=full residualization)\n    center: if True, center Z globally before regression and re-add mean after residualization\n    Returns Z_resid (n, d)\n    \"\"\"\n    Z = np.asarray(Z, dtype=np.float32)\n    n, d = Z.shape\n    batches = np.asarray(batches)\n    uniq = np.unique(batches)\n    B = np.zeros((n, len(uniq)), dtype=np.float32)\n    for k, u in enumerate(uniq):\n        B[:, k] = (batches == u).astype(np.float32)\n\n    if center:\n        mu = Z.mean(axis=0, keepdims=True)\n        Zc = Z - mu\n    else:\n        mu\
    \ = 0.0\n        Zc = Z\n\n    # Solve ridge: W = (B^T B + l2 I)^-1 B^T Zc, shape (nbatch, d)\n    BtB = B.T @ B\n    BtZ = B.T @ Zc\n    reg = l2 * np.eye(BtB.shape[0], dtype=np.float32)\n    W = np.linalg.solve(BtB + reg, BtZ)\n\n    Z_pred = B @ W  # batch-predicted component\n    Z_resid = Zc - gamma * Z_pred\n    if center:\n        Z_resid = Z_resid + mu\n    return Z_resid\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
