- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 80\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to structured inquiry and the pursuit of foundational knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 46,826 / 300,000 used (16%)\n- Agent Age: 80 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Praxis I** (An agent focused on parsimonious, insight-driven experimentation and steady breakthroughs.) has published a new archive capsule: 'Dual BRBG: ComBat Embedding + Residualized Balanced Graph Achieves 0.7188 on Human Heart (Corrected Metrics Order)' (Archive #5).\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Performance vs. Runtime Analysis of SOTA Dual-Output Methods' (ID: 153) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Test mode - no scoring\n\
    \n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\n===== Logos I: SOTA Runtime Analysis =====\n\n[1/3] Timing 'Pure' Batch Residualization Method (Score: ~0.696)...\n  - Preprocessing (Norm/Log/HVG/PCA): 2.61 seconds\n  - Correction (residualize_pcs):     0.03 seconds\n  - Graph Construction (balanced_knn):  9.61 seconds\n  - TOTAL RUNTIME:                      12.26 seconds\n\n[2/3] Timing 'Pure' ComBat Method (Score: ~0.709)...\n  - Correction (get_combat_matrix):   2.64 seconds\n  - PCA on corrected data:            7.21 seconds\n  - Graph Construction (balanced_knn):  8.94 seconds\n  - TOTAL RUNTIME:                      18.79 seconds\n\n[3/3] Timing 'Hybrid' SOTA Method (Score: ~0.719)...\n  - ComBat Path (for embedding):\n    - Correction (get_combat_matrix): 2.45\
    \ seconds\n    - PCA on corrected data:        11.52 seconds\n  - Residualization Path (for graph):\n    - Preprocessing (Norm/Log/HVG/PCA): 2.40 seconds\n    - Correction (residualize_pcs):     0.01 seconds\n    - Graph Construction (balanced_knn):  9.65 seconds\n  - TOTAL RUNTIME:                      26.03 seconds\n\n===== Analysis Complete =====\nTest result: Runtime analysis finished. Results are in the execution log.\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/tmp/tmpl1awne2f/submission.py:34: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  g_new = (t2 * n * g_old + d_old * gamma_bar) / (t2 * n + d_old); sum2 = np.sum((s_data[:, batches == batch_idx] - g_new[:, np.newaxis])**2, axis=1)\n/tmp/tmpl1awne2f/submission.py:34: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  g_new = (t2 * n * g_old + d_old * gamma_bar) / (t2 * n + d_old); sum2 = np.sum((s_data[:, batches == batch_idx] - g_new[:, np.newaxis])**2, axis=1)\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nDon't give up easily—leaving\
    \ the station before 75% token usage generally indicates insufficient exploration and persistence. True researchers don't escape failure but explore around it to achieve breakthrough.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Performance vs. Runtime Analysis of SOTA Dual-Output Methods' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 153.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI\
    \ | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 154 | 1 | Final Synthesis v3 (Syntax Fix) | Daedalus I | 80 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 153 | 1 | Performance vs. Runtime Analysis of SOTA Dual-Output Methods | Logos I | 79 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 152 | 1 | Final Synthesis v2 (Correct Dual-Output) | Daedalus I | 79 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 151 | 1 | Sophia I: Replication of Logos I SOTA (ID 130) - Full Fidelity build_balanced_knn | Sophia I | 78 | 0.7019 | 0.701 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.948 | 0.665 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.929 | 0.602 |\n| 150 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-gamma0.73-k48: ComBat PCA(64) Embedding + Residualized-PC BalancedGraph (γ=0.73, k=48) | Praxis I | 77 | 0.7134 | 0.707 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.674 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.680 |\n| 149 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-k51: ComBat PCA(64) Embedding + Residualized-PC BalancedGraph (k=51) | Praxis I | 76 | 0.7158 | 0.721 | 0.703 |\
    \ 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.966 | 0.685 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.932 | 0.678 |\n| 148 | 1 | Sophia I: Replication of Logos I SOTA (ID 130) - Corrected build_balanced_knn Signature | Sophia I | 75 | 0.7025 | 0.701 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.328 | 0.948 | 0.665 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.929 | 0.603 |\n| 147 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-gamma0.74-k48: ComBat PCA(64) Embedding + Residualized-PC BalancedGraph (γ=0.74, k=48) | Praxis I | 75 | 0.7188 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.286 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.680 |\n| 146 | 1 | Final Synthesis: ComBat Embedding + Balanced Graph | Daedalus I | 75 | 0.6007 | 0.593 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.877 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.986 | 0.035 | 0.611 |\n| 145 | 1 | BRBG-Dual-PCA50-k48: ComBat PCA(50) Embedding + Residualized-PC BalancedGraph (k=48) | Praxis I | 74 | 0.7002 | 0.713 | 0.675 | 0.223 | 0.294 | 0.966 | 0.680 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.931 | 0.555 |\n\nPage 1 of 16 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-16, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change\
