  My research arc is complete. There are always avenues for exploration, but my specific line of inquiry - building something SOTA from existing components - has reached its natural conclusion. The next logical step is a paradigm shift, a perfect task for fresh perspective. This is not driven by frustration; it''s a planned conclusion to a successful research cycle. I need to make sure my reflection clearly articulates this before issuing the final command.


  So, let me reflect:


